<title>TURKEY: TURKISH WHOLESALE PRICES UP 3.4 PCT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>TURKISH WHOLESALE PRICES UP 3.4 PCT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's wholesale prices rose 3.4 percent month-on-month in June, compared to a rise of 5.2 percent in May, the State Statistics Institute said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said consumer prices climbed 2.9 percent in June, after a rise of 4.7 percent in May.</p>
</text>
